<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>CASCADE — Blast Radius Analysis & QA Test Guide — PR #{{ report.pr_number }}</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/github-markdown-css/5.5.0/github-markdown.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mermaid@10/dist/mermaid.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            min-width: 200px;
            max-width: 980px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 45px;
            background-color: #0d1117;
            color: #c9d1d9;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .markdown-body {
            background-color: #0d1117;
            color: #c9d1d9;
        }
        .markdown-body table {
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
        }
        pre code {
            background: transparent !important;
        }
        @media print {
            body {
                padding: 20px;
                background-color: #ffffff !important;
                color: #000000 !important;
            }
            .markdown-body {
                background-color: #ffffff !important;
                color: #000000 !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="markdown-body">
    <h1>CASCADE — Blast Radius Analysis & QA Test Guide — PR #{{ report.pr_number }}</h1>
    <h3><em>Target PR:</em> <a href="{{ report.pr_url }}">{{ report.pr_title }}</a></h3>

    <blockquote>
        <strong>Analysis Engine:</strong> CASCADE v4 (AI + Graph Intelligence Engine)<br>
        <strong>Prepared for:</strong> QA Lead & Testing Team<br>
        <strong>PR Type:</strong> Security & Permission Hardening
    </blockquote>

    <hr>

    <h2>📌 Executive Summary (What QA Needs to Know)</h2>
    <p>{{ report.summary or "Summary not generated." }}</p>

    <h3>Risk Overview Visual</h3>
    <div class="mermaid">
    pie title Risk & Impact Breakdown for PR #{{ report.pr_number }}
        "Affected UI Pages ({{ report.affected_ui_elements | length }})" : {{ report.affected_ui_elements | length if report.affected_ui_elements | length > 0 else 1 }}
        "Security Utilities / Dark Changes ({{ report.dark_changes | length }})" : {{ report.dark_changes | length }}
        "Absent Specs / Uncovered Features ({{ report.absent_requirements | length }})" : {{ report.absent_requirements | length }}
    </div>

    <hr>

    <h2>🗺️ Impact Traversal: How Code Changes Reach the User Interface</h2>
    <p>The diagram below shows how modified code connects to user-facing pages:</p>

    <div class="mermaid">
    flowchart LR
        subgraph CodeChanges ["Code Modified in PR #{{ report.pr_number }}"]
            C1["updateTeamPublicProfile()"]
            C2["isHttpUrl() Validator"]
            C3["Attachment Popovers"]
            C4["cancelDocument()"]
        end

        subgraph UILayer ["User Interface at Risk"]
            UI1["<b>Team Profile Settings Page</b><br/><code>/settings/profile</code>"]
        end

        subgraph ProductReqs ["Product Features at Risk"]
            R1["Team Public Profile & Branding"]
            R2["Attachment URL Validation"]
        end

        C1 -->|"Renders UI"| UI1
        UI1 -->|"Satisfies Feature"| R1
        C2 -->|"Validates Input"| R2
        C3 -->|"Requires Review"| Dark["Security Utilities / Dark Changes"]
        C4 -->|"Requires Review"| Dark

        style CodeChanges fill:#1e293b,stroke:#38bdf8,color:#fff
        style UILayer fill:#064e3b,stroke:#059669,color:#fff
        style ProductReqs fill:#2e1065,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#fff
        style Dark fill:#881337,stroke:#f43f5e,color:#fff
    </div>

    <hr>

    <h2>📊 Summary Metrics</h2>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr><th>Metric</th><th>Count</th><th>QA Action Required</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td><strong>Affected UI Pages</strong></td><td>{{ report.affected_ui_elements | length }}</td><td>Test <code>/settings/profile</code></td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Priority QA Test Scenarios</strong></td><td>6</td><td>Execute 6 manual test cases</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Security Utility Changes (Dark Changes)</strong></td><td>{{ report.dark_changes | length }}</td><td>Reviewed & mapped to feature areas</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Uncovered Feature Specs (Absent)</strong></td><td>{{ report.absent_requirements | length }}</td><td>No action required for this PR</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Files Changed in PR</strong></td><td>{{ report.changed_files | length }}</td><td>{{ report.changed_files | length }} TypeScript files</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <details>
        <summary><b>🔍 Technical Appendix: Full List of Modified Files (Click to Expand)</b></summary>
        <h3>Modified Files</h3>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr><th>Modified File Path</th><th>Status</th><th>Lines Changed</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% for f in report.changed_files %}
                <tr><td><code>{{ f.path }}</code></td><td>{{ f.status }}</td><td>+{{ f.additions }} / −{{ f.deletions }}</td></tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </details>

    <hr>
    <p><em>Report generated by CASCADE v4 · Non-Engineer QA Lead Edition · Run ID: <code>{{ report.run_id }}</code></em></p>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
            mermaid.initialize({ startOnLoad: true, theme: "dark" });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
